# Per-origin aggregates and DuckDB spill files are large and reproducible from the
# export; a run's summary.md, tables/ and run-*.json are small and may be committed.
results/*/parts/
results/*/work/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
# the repo root ignores *.md; a run's summaries and the superseded pointer are meant
# to be committed. Narrow patterns, so a stray notes.md / debug.md from a future
# model agent does not silently become committable.
!results/*/summary*.md
!results/*/SUPERSEDED.md
